|---|----------|------------|------|--------------------|-----------|---------|---------------|
| 1 | G1 | Provide Meal Service | Ensure that food delivery and dish retrieval are performed for inpatient rooms. | # | Achieve | – | Both sub‑goals (delivery & dishes) must hold; they can be executed in parallel. |
| 2 | G2 | Deliver Food | Process order‑based food delivery to inpatient rooms. | ; | Perform | AND | Delivery is a necessary part of the overall service. |
| 3 | G3 | Retrieve Dishes | Retrieve dirty dishes from inpatient rooms. | ; | Perform | AND | Dish retrieval is another necessary part of the overall service. |
| 4 | G2.1 | Process Delivery Request | Receive and parse order request from kitchen. | – | Perform | AND | Must be done before any delivery action. |
