|10 | G3.1.1 | Retrieve Unassisted | Robot retrieves dishes alone. | – | Perform | OR | Used when robot can handle the load by itself. |
|11 | G3.1.2 | Retrieve with Two Robots | Two robots cooperate to retrieve dishes. | – | Perform | OR | Needed for heavier or multiple dishes. |
|12 | G3.1.3 | Retrieve with Human | Robot cooperates with human to retrieve dishes. | – | Perform | OR | Used when human assistance is required (e.g., patient’s condition). |

